Legion of Doom (LOD) is NOT back !!

As I stated in an earlier post, my part in the misguided
attempt to restart the Legion of Doom hacking group is ended.
The reasons for this are as I said in my previous message,
that (a) I don't have the right to use the name LOD, a group
that I have never had anything to do with; (b) I recieved much
negative feedback from real ex-LOD members who did not feel
that I should be tainting the name of LOD by trying to regroup
it; (c) I have not gotten any articles fit for publication in
the new LOD Journals (other than The Spike's "Hacking MCI
Codez" file which is a few years out of date); (d) I stand to
gain nothing by continueing this venture other than the scorn
and contempt of anyone who is familiar with the facts; and
finally (e) my parents (who I live with) have received several
calls from Law Enforcment personell who heard about what I
was doing and I got grounded for two weeks.

Therefore as of May 18 I totally discontinued my efforts to
revive the once-great Legion of Doom and decided to allow it
to continue to rest in peace and dignity. I will have no
further part in using the LOD name or publishing journals
under the LOD name. Let that be the final word.

Anyone who has spoken with me voice knows that I have a
stuttering problem. Even though this is a physical defect
over which I have no control and which does not reflect a
lack of intelligence, it has nonetheless earned me several
enemies in the phreaking/hacking community who get pleasure
from attacking someone with a speech impediment. These same
people are trying to get me into serious trouble and they
posted the last USENET message supposedly from me saying that
I was continuing on with the LOD revival effort. To all
ex-LOD members and Security and Law Enforcement persons: it
was NOT really from me! >This< message is the real me! Don't
let my enemies trick you into thinking that I am still going
ahead with the LOD revival. They just want to see me get into
more trouble with the real LOD, my parents, Bell and the
authorities. Call me voice and I will explain it to you
(my number is below).

My voice phone number was changed by my parents on May 23
because some people were calling very late at night. My new
number is listed below but PLEASE remember that I am in the
Eastern Time zone, so all you West Coast phreakers are three
hours earlier! So do me a favor and don't call too late or
my parents will get really upset. If everyone will show a
little consideration I'm sure we can put this thing to rest.

Finally, let me say here and now that all efforts on my part
to get the LOD started up again are null and void and defunct.
I'm sorry for all the trouble I've caused to everyone.

